  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1064/219/bannerfulldownscaled.png\" alt=\"Modern Mizuno&#x27;s 橫幅\"></p>\n<h1>Modern Mizuno's</h1>\n<p>美津濃（Mizuno）的 16x 材質包在我能長期留戀於《我的世界》的過程中扮演了重要角色，其卡通與溫馨的氛圍將永遠佔據我心。<br>\n不幸的是，針對《我的世界》Java 版最新內容的官方更新似乎已經停止。&nbsp;<br>\n我希望透過這個附加模組，作為我們摯愛的 16x 材質包的非官方更新，讓 Mizuno's 在現代遊戲中繼續活躍，該材質包也孕育出了充滿活力的社群。</p>\n<p>想協助讓 Mizuno's 延續生命，並為本材質包提供建議嗎？歡迎加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>，我們隨時歡迎您的反饋！</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>目前，本材質包已支援「蒼翠花園」（Pale Garden）更新（1.21.4）中的大部分方塊，我計畫持續開發，直到所有新資源都符合經典 Mizuno 風格為止。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><p>點擊查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgsli.com%252fMzg4MzE4%252f2%252f3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>滑動對比展示</strong></a>，看看本材質包新增了哪些內容！</p><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2025/431/18897816-slidercomparison_l.webp\" alt=\"蒼翠花園更新前後對比展示\" width=\"800\" height=\"427\"></div>\n<h2>安裝方式</h2>\n<p>本材質包為附加模組，並未包含任何 Mizuno 原有的紋理，您仍需 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fresourcepack.net%252fmizunos-16-craft-resource-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載原始材質包</a>，但請務必將本模組置於載入順序的最頂端！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9dHuFRY9/images/86f348e50df1b822cde1338e30faebc73aa5813d.png\" alt=\"載入順序示意圖\"></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fmodern-mizuno-s-pale-oak-showcase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載展示所使用的版本！</a></em><br>\n<em>需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmizunomcmemo.blogspot.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's 16x JE</a></em><br>\n<em>推薦查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252fua1AmdlB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overgrown Flowery GUI</a>，本展示圖片即使用了該介面！</em><br>\n<em>推薦查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fastralex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Astralex Shaders</a>，橫幅圖片即使用了該光影！</em><br>\n<em>部分資源衍生自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssal-decor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abyssal Decor</a>。</em><br>\n<em>部分資源衍生自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpixel-perfection-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection Legacy</a></em><br>\n<em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252flYx28E34%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">探索更多 Mizuno 材質包與附加模組</a></em><br>\n<em>本材質包使用了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fVoPLAAlB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Everybody Loves: Bees</a> 的資源。</em></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcoolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/coolbot100s/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fcollection%252f146032%252fall-garden-gals-content%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Bouncy-Leaves/assets/76798835/0b2c0293-c2ab-4956-9055-70bc7d7141c5\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"> </a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/generic-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持我們\"></a></div>",
